Chapter: PropNegFalse

 The sign is the thing under test, and -1 is chosen so that a fold
 losing it lands here: if the normalizer ever folded to a magnitude and
 dropped the sign, or refused to fold a negative and left the spine
 stuck against a literal, this proof would stop being rejected for the
 right reason. It must fail with a mismatch naming Con:-2.

Section: Bad Proof

  claim wrong-sign : 1 - 3 === -1
  proof wrong-sign = Refl
  qed

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "unreachable"
  end
